                            <strong>
                                AM5 / DDR5
                            </strong>

                        </div>


                        <div>

                            <span>
                                Work
                            </span>

                            <strong>
                                Assembly, Configuration & Testing
                            </strong>

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </article>


            <!-- =========================================
                 BUILD 2
                 5600X + RTX 3070
            ========================================== -->

            <article class="pc-build-card">

                <div class="pc-build-photo">

                    <img src="/images/pc/5600x_3070.jpg"
                         alt="Ryzen 5 5600X and RTX 3070 gaming PC" />

                </div>


                <div class="pc-build-info">

                    <p class="pc-build-label">
                        GAMING BUILD
                    </p>

                    <h2>
                        Ryzen 5 5600X + RTX 3070
                    </h2>

                    <p>
                        A gaming-focused system assembled, configured,
