                            <strong>
                                Ryzen 5 5600X
                            </strong>

                        </div>


                        <div>

                            <span>
                                GPU
                            </span>

                            <strong>
                                GeForce RTX 3070
                            </strong>

                        </div>


                        <div>

                            <span>
                                Platform
                            </span>

                            <strong>
                                AM4 / DDR4
                            </strong>

                        </div>


                        <div>

                            <span>
                                Work
                            </span>

                            <strong>
                                Assembly, Setup & Stress Testing
                            </strong>

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </article>


            <!-- =========================================
                 BUILD 3
                 5600 + RTX 3070
            ========================================== -->

            <article class="pc-build-card">

                <div class="pc-build-photo">

                    <img src="/images/pc/5600_3070.jpeg"
                         alt="Ryzen 5 5600 and RTX 3070 gaming PC" />

                </div>


                <div class="pc-build-info">

                    <p class="pc-build-label">
                        CUSTOM GAMING BUILD
                    </p>

                    <h2>
                        Ryzen 5 5600 + RTX 3070
                    </h2>

                    <p>
                        A custom gaming PC assembled and configured for
