                            <strong>
                                AM4 / DDR4
                            </strong>

                        </div>


                        <div>

                            <span>
                                Work
                            </span>

                            <strong>
                                Build, Configuration & Diagnostics
                            </strong>

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </article>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =========================================
         MY PROCESS
    ========================================== -->

    <section class="pc-build-section">

        <h2 class="section-title">
            My Process
        </h2>


        <div class="pc-process-grid">

            <div class="pc-process-card">

                <span>
                    01
                </span>

                <h3>
                    Component Selection
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Check compatibility, power requirements,
                    performance targets and component value.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="pc-process-card">

                <span>
                    02
                </span>

                <h3>
                    Assembly
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Install hardware, cooling, storage, fans,
                    power connections and complete cable management.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="pc-process-card">

                <span>
                    03
                </span>

                <h3>
                    Configuration
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Configure BIOS, memory profiles, Windows,
                    chipset drivers and graphics drivers.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="pc-process-card">

                <span>
                    04
                </span>

                <h3>
                    Testing
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Test system performance, temperatures and
                    stability using benchmarks and monitoring tools.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="pc-process-card">

                <span>
                    05
                </span>

                <h3>
                    Troubleshooting
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Diagnose hardware, thermal, display,
                    driver and system stability problems.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="pc-process-card">

                <span>
                    06
                </span>

                <h3>
                    Customer Support
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Prepare systems for customers and provide
                    assistance with setup and technical questions.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =========================================
         TESTING & TOOLS
    ========================================== -->

    <section class="pc-build-section">

        <h2 class="section-title">
            Testing & Tools
        </h2>


        <div class="pc-tool-box">

            <div class="skill-tags">

                <span>3DMark</span>

                <span>Cinebench</span>

                <span>FurMark</span>

                <span>HWiNFO</span>

                <span>BIOS / UEFI</span>

                <span>Windows 11</span>

                <span>GPU Drivers</span>

                <span>Chipset Drivers</span>

                <span>Temperature Monitoring</span>

                <span>Stress Testing</span>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>

</section>